[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3230335156","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110032#issuecomment-3230335156","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110032","id":3230335156,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AiwC0","user":{"login":"dog-on-moon","id":159832633,"node_id":"U_kgDOCYbaOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159832633?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon","html_url":"https://github.com/dog-on-moon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T00:19:33Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T00:19:33Z","body":"Also I think the code here will also need a similar fix (noticed similar jittering with colliders), but `Node3D::get_global_transform` is const and `Node3D::get_global_transform_interpolated` isn't (which the compiler is upset about), and I'm not C++ savvy enough to know what the preferred way of addressing it is :P \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4ebf67c12dcdffcb69242569c118a371a654b6ae/scene/3d/spring_bone_collision_3d.cpp#L152-L160","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3230335156/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3231808833","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110032#issuecomment-3231808833","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110032","id":3231808833,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AoX1B","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T04:19:13Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T04:38:02Z","body":"> Node3D::get_global_transform is const and Node3D::get_global_transform_interpolated isn't (which the compiler is upset about), and I'm not C++ savvy enough to know what the preferred way of addressing it is :P\r\n\r\nYou may be able to simply make `get_global_transform_interpolated()` const, this is likely historical from before `SceneTreeFTI` (might be used by the ifdeffed backup path, but that's just for testing).\r\n\r\nThis is very probably fine but I haven't looked at all at this class (it may not be present in 3.x), so it could do with checking by someone more familiar with `SpringBone3D`.\r\n\r\nOften things like this are processed on physics tick in which case the non-interpolated is fine, but if this is causing a problem presumably it is being called on the frame. `get_transform_interpolated()` should work either way and fallback to the normal method if called on a physics tick.\r\n\r\nBTW I would also double check this function is not being called on invisible nodes, as `get_global_transform_interpolated()` can get rather expensive when called on invisible nodes (as the xform has to be calculated through the chain on demand).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3231808833/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4035500656","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110032#issuecomment-4035500656","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110032","id":4035500656,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wiNpw","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-11T01:12:49Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T01:12:49Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4035500656/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]